<title>USA: Norstan Inc Q1 Aug 3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Norstan Inc Q1 Aug 3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the quarter ended</p>
<p>							    Aug 3,  Jul 29,</p>
<p>								1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues						 $92,231 $72,401</p>
<p> Cost of sales					   66,900  51,983</p>
<p> Gross margin					    25,331  20,418</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative expenses</p>
<p>							     22,180  17,680</p>
<p> Operating income					 3,151   2,738</p>
<p>    Interest expense				    (241)   (398)</p>
<p>    Other income, net					 7	49</p>
<p> Income before provision for income taxes	 2,917   2,389</p>
<p>    Provision for income taxes			1,225     956</p>
<p> Net income						 1,692   1,433</p>
<p> Net income per share				    0.18    0.16</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common</p>
<p>    equivalent shares outstanding		   9,323   8,948</p>
<p>	   (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
